  "description_html": "Sizes of the saltwater crocodile.\n<ul><li>The \"very large male\" individual is based on measurements in Britton <i>et al.</i> (2012).<sup id=\"cite_ref-Britton_et_al._2012_1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Britton_et_al._2012-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> Although larger specimens have been reported, their sizes are only estimates based on available imagery or skull sizes.</li>\n<li>The \"typical adult male\" is based on Basu <i>et al.</i> (2023).<sup id=\"cite_ref-Basu_et_al._2023_2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Basu_et_al._2023-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li>The \"very large female\" individual is based on Wood (1983).<sup id=\"cite_ref-Wood_3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Wood-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li>The \"typical adult female\" is based on measurements in Kay (2004)<sup id=\"cite_ref-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> and Campbell <i>et al.</i> (2013).<sup id=\"cite_ref-Campbell_5-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Campbell-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li></ul>\n<p>The human scaled to 180 cm.\n</p><p><i>C. porosus</i> silhouette based on Grigg &amp; Gans (1993)<sup id=\"cite_ref-Grigg_&amp;_Gans_6-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Grigg_&amp;_Gans-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> and Britton <i>et al.</i> (2012).<sup id=\"cite_ref-Britton_et_al._2012_1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Britton_et_al._2012-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\nThe human silhouette extracted from <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Large_crocodyliformes.svg\" title=\"File:Large crocodyliformes.svg\">File:Large_crocodyliformes.svg</a>.",
